sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant VC as Vercel Cron (vercel.json)
    participant CD as GET api/cron/check-deadline
    participant SD as GET api/cron/send-digest
    participant CL as 4 cron dọn dẹp (cleanup-notifications, auth-cleanup, hard-delete-workspaces, hard-delete-profiles)
    participant RJ as GET api/cron/review-janitor
    participant MX as Mux (bên ngoài)
    participant WH as POST api/webhooks/mux
    participant ING as Inngest serve (api/inngest, 4 fn)
    participant LIB as lib notification-email + email
    participant RS as Resend API
    participant R2 as Cloudflare R2
    participant DB as Prisma / Neon

    Note over VC,DB: KHỐI 1 — cron check-deadline (mỗi giờ)
    VC->>CD: GET kèm x-cron-secret
    alt CRON_SECRET chưa cấu hình
        CD-->>VC: 500 CRON_SECRET not configured
    else key khác secret
        CD-->>VC: 401 Unauthorized
    else key hợp lệ
        CD->>DB: task.findMany deadline trong 1h/24h, status in OVERDUE_ELIGIBLE_STATUSES
        CD->>DB: notification.findFirst dedup theo taskId + tier
        CD->>DB: createNotificationInternal TASK_DEADLINE_APPROACHING (tier 1h rồi 24h)
        CD->>DB: task.update status = Quá hạn (deadline đã qua)
        CD->>DB: createNotificationInternal TASK_OVERDUE (dedup)
        alt lỗi DB
            CD-->>VC: 500 Failed
        else thành công
            CD-->>VC: 200 processed danh sách
        end
    end

    Note over VC,RS: KHỐI 2 — cron send-digest (mỗi giờ)
    VC->>SD: GET kèm x-cron-secret
    alt guard secret fail
        SD-->>VC: 401 / 500 (cùng pattern)
    else hợp lệ
        SD->>LIB: sendDigestEmails HOURLY
        LIB->>DB: notificationPreference.findMany emailDigestMode + emailEnabled
        loop mỗi user có pref
            alt HOURLY và đang quiet hours
                LIB->>LIB: skip user (skipped++)
            else có notification emailSentAt null
                LIB->>DB: notification.findMany emailSentAt null, isArchived false, take 50
                LIB->>RS: sendEmail digest (templates digestHourly/digestDaily)
                LIB->>DB: notification.updateMany emailSentAt = now
            end
        end
        opt utcHour bằng 1 (8h sáng VN)
            SD->>LIB: sendDigestEmails DAILY
        end
        SD-->>VC: 200 hourly + daily + ranDailyDigest
    end

    Note over VC,DB: KHỐI 3 — 4 cron dọn dẹp hàng ngày
    VC->>CL: GET kèm x-cron-secret (auth-cleanup dùng safeEqual timingSafeEqual)
    alt guard secret fail
        CL-->>VC: 401 / 500
    else hợp lệ
        CL->>DB: cleanup-notifications — notification.deleteMany archived hơn 30d, read hơn 90d
        CL->>DB: auth-cleanup — deleteMany EmailVerificationToken expired, PasswordResetOTP expired/consumed 7d, LoginAttempt hơn 90d
        CL->>DB: hard-delete-workspaces — audit workspace.hard_deleted rồi workspace.delete cascade (hardDeleteAfter đã qua)
        CL->>DB: hard-delete-profiles — audit profile.hard_deleted rồi profile.delete cascade
        alt cột status/hardDeleteAfter chưa migrate (P2009)
            CL-->>VC: 200 deleted 0, skipped migration pending
        else thành công
            CL-->>VC: 200 số bản ghi đã xóa
        end
    end

    Note over VC,DB: KHỐI 4 — cron review-janitor 20h UTC → Inngest reviewJanitor
    VC->>RJ: GET kèm x-cron-secret
    alt guard secret fail
        RJ-->>VC: 401 / 500
    else hợp lệ
        RJ->>ING: inngest.send review/janitor.requested
        alt send lỗi
            RJ-->>VC: 502 inngest send failed
        else ok
            RJ-->>VC: 200 success
        end
    end
    ING->>ING: chạy fn reviewJanitor (retries 2, 5 sweep)
    ING->>DB: (a) uploadSession hết hạn → expireInflightUpload — UPLOADING sang FAILED + abort R2 multipart
    ING->>DB: (b) redrive UPLOADED kẹt quá 15p → reconcileStuckUploadedVersion → driveCompletion
    ING->>MX: (c) PROCESSING kẹt quá 20p → getMuxAsset đối chiếu
    alt Mux trả 404
        ING->>DB: applyMuxErrored — Mux không còn asset
    else asset ready/errored
        ING->>DB: applyMuxReady / applyMuxErrored (cùng hàm với webhook)
    else vẫn preparing quá 24h
        ING->>DB: applyMuxErrored quá thời gian
        ING->>MX: deleteMuxAsset asset kẹt (chỉ khi đã FAILED)
    end
    ING->>DB: (d) webhookEvent processedAt null tuổi 1h..7d → re-send review/mux.event.received
    ING->>DB: (e) purgeExpiredTrash — xóa Mux + R2 + DB rows trash quá 30 ngày

    Note over MX,DB: KHỐI 5 — webhook Mux → Inngest reviewMuxWebhook
    MX->>WH: POST body + header Mux-Signature t,v1
    alt chữ ký HMAC sai hoặc lệch quá 5 phút
        WH-->>MX: 401 invalid signature (Mux sẽ retry)
    else JSON hỏng
        WH-->>MX: 400 bad json
    else hợp lệ
        WH->>DB: webhookEvent.create id = Mux event id (ledger)
        alt P2002 trùng id (redelivery)
            WH-->>MX: 200 duplicated true — không bắn lại event
        else ghi mới
            WH->>ING: inngest.send review/mux.event.received
            Note right of WH: send lỗi chỉ log — vẫn trả 200, janitor (d) sẽ re-enqueue
            WH-->>MX: 200 ok
            ING->>DB: step load-event — webhookEvent.findUnique
            alt ledger mất hoặc processedAt đã set
                ING->>ING: return skipped / duplicate
            else type video.asset.ready
                ING->>DB: applyMuxReady — flip PROCESSING sang READY + reviewState AWAITING_REVIEW + currentVersionId + clear statusId approved
                ING->>DB: revokeClientExposureOnNewVersion + syncTaskFromReviewEvent (task sang trạng thái submitted)
                ING->>DB: notifyReview + notifyManagerOfReviewFlip + auditReviewFeed
                alt outcome unexpected (version chưa PROCESSING)
                    ING->>ING: throw để Inngest retry (tối đa 4)
                end
            else type video.asset.errored
                ING->>DB: applyMuxErrored — flip PROCESSING/UPLOADED sang FAILED + errorMessage
            else type khác
                ING->>ING: ignored — chỉ log
            end
            ING->>DB: step mark-processed — processedAt = now (ghi CUỐI để retry an toàn)
        end
    end

    Note over R2,ING: KHỐI 6 — 2 fn Inngest còn lại (nguồn event ngoài F16)
    ING->>ING: reviewProcessUpload (event review/upload.completed từ driveCompletion)
    ING->>R2: getObjectRange 4KB — verify magic bytes
    alt nội dung không phải video
        ING->>DB: flip PROCESSING sang FAILED — nội dung tệp không hợp lệ
    else video hợp lệ
        ING->>R2: ensureColorTaggedInput BT709 + presignGetObject 24h
        ING->>MX: createMuxAsset inputUrl + passthrough versionId
        ING->>DB: store muxAssetId (guard PROCESSING + null, xóa asset thừa nếu thua cuộc)
    end
    ING->>ING: reviewShareDecision (event review/decision.recorded từ route decision)
    ING->>DB: load-state — reviewState khớp + version là head, không thì skip superseded
    alt decision request_changes
        ING->>DB: syncTaskOnChangesRequested (backup idempotent)
    else decision approve
        ING->>DB: task.updateMany clientReview APPROVED (guard isArchived false)
    end
    ING->>DB: audit task.client_approved / task.client_changes_requested

